7,1) A tariff is a tax that is imposed by the ________ country when an ________ good crosses its international boundary.,A) exporting; imported,B) importing; exported,C) exporting; exported,D) importing; imported,E) importing or exporting; imported or exported,D,International Trade Restrictions,False
