11,1) The short run is a time frame in which,A) the firm is not able to hire more workers.,B) the amount of output produced is fixed.,C) there is a shortage of most factors of production.,D) at least one factor of production is fixed.,E) there is not enough time to make all of the decisions necessary to maximize profit.,D,Decision Time Frames,False
