13,1) Which area in Figure 13.4.1 indicates the deadweight loss from a perfect price-discriminating monopoly?,A) EACF,B) ACD,C) ABD,D) BCD,E) None of the above.,E,Price Discrimination,False
13,"2) When perfect price discrimination occurs, which one of the following statements is false ?",A) Buyers cannot resell the product.,B) The firm can distinguish between buyers.,C) The firm sets prices.,D) The firm captures consumer surplus.,E) The outcome is less efficient than with single-price monopoly.,E,Price Discrimination,False
