13,"18) Refer to Figure 13.4.4. Consider a market with a monopoly that distinguishes between two groups of buyers. If the light grey area shows the consumer surplus and the dark grey area shows the producer surplus, which graphs correctly represents this firm?",A) (a),B) (b),C) (c),D) (d),E) (b) and (d),C,Price Discrimination,False
