13,"12) Consider the natural monopoly depicted in Figure 13.5.2. If a regulator uses a marginal cost pricing rule, what line segment gives the amount of subsidy per unit of output that will be required to assure that the monopolist will remain in business?",A) BA,B) CA,C) DE,D) GF,E) CB,D,Monopoly Regulation,False
