17,17) Which of the following quotations describes a rival good?,"A) ""Mom, Ashley is looking at me.""","B) ""Mom, Morgan won't let me watch the Backyardigans because she is watching Dora the Explorer.""","C) ""Mom, Harrison won't let me in his room.""","D) ""Mom, Taylor told me on the phone that he is also watching the Backyardigans on TV at his house.""","E) ""Mom said everyone in this house gets to enjoy the flowers in the garden.""",B,Classifying Goods and Resources,False
