17,19) A common resource is,A) rival and either excludable or nonexcludable.,B) excludable and either rival or nonrival.,C) rival and excludable.,D) rival and nonexcludable.,E) nonexcludable and either rival or nonrival.,D,Classifying Goods and Resources,False
