18,19) When the price of a firm's output increases,A) the supply of labour increases.,B) the firm hires less labour.,C) the marginal product of labour increases.,D) the firm's demand for labour curve shifts leftward.,E) the value of marginal product of labour increases.,E,The Demand for a Factor of Production,False
