18,"25) Refer to Table 18.2.2. If the price of apples is $0.50 per kilogram, the value of marginal product of the 5th student is",A) $0.50 an hour.,B) $72.50 an hour.,C) $14.50 an hour.,D) $12.50 an hour.,E) $10 an hour.,D,The Demand for a Factor of Production,False
