19,1) Which of the following does Statistics Canada use to provide measures of economic inequality?,A) market income only,B) market income and after-tax income only,C) after-tax income only,D) total market and after-tax income only,"E) market income, total income, and after-tax income",E,Measuring Economic Inequality,False
