19,"40) Globalization ________ the demand for high-skilled workers and ________ the demand for low-skilled workers in Canada. As a result, income inequality in Canada ________.",A) decreases; increases; decreases,B) increases; decreases; increases,C) decreases; decreases; decreases,D) increases; increases; decreases,E) increases; does not change; increases,B,The Sources of Economic Inequality,False
