21,24) Michael lost his job as a night security guard because he kept falling asleep at the job. Now he is looking for a new job. Michael is,A) frictionally unemployed.,B) structurally unemployed.,C) not unemployed.,D) cyclically unemployed.,E) none of the above.,A,Unemployment and Full Employment,False
