23,"11) The Acme Stereo Company had a capital stock of $24 million at the beginning of the year. At the end of the year, the firm had a capital stock of $20 million. Thus its",A) net investment was some amount but we need more information to determine the amount.,B) net investment was $4 million for the year.,C) gross investment was zero.,D) net investment was -$4 million for the year.,E) depreciation was $4 million.,D,Financial Institutions and Financial Markets,False
