23,"1) If net taxes exceed government expenditures, the government sector has a budget ________ and government saving is ________.",A) surplus; positive,B) surplus; negative,C) deficit; positive,D) deficit; negative,E) balance that is zero; zero,A,Government in the Market for Loanable Funds,False
