24,14) Which one of the following items is not included in the M1 definition of money?,A) Currency outside banks.,B) Personal chequable deposits.,C) Non-personal chequable deposits.,D) Fixed term deposits.,E) Neither B nor D are part of M1.,D,What Is Money?,False
24,15) The largest component of M1 is,A) currency outside banks.,B) personal chequable deposits.,C) non-personal chequable deposits.,D) fixed term deposits.,E) non-personal non-chequable deposits.,C,What Is Money?,False
