24,13) Refer to Figure 24.4.2. Which one of the following best describes the response to a rise in the price level?,A) A movement from A to B.,B) A movement from A to C.,C) A movement from A to F.,D) A movement from A to E.,E) None of the above.,E,The Market for Money,False
