24,16) The demand for money in Canada reveals which of the following?,A) An inverse relationship between M1 and the interest rate.,B) An inverse relationship between M2 and the interest rate.,C) A decrease in the demand for M1 during the 1980s.,D) A decrease in the demand for M2 during the 1990s.,E) All of the above.,E,The Market for Money,False
