24,"18) If households and firms find they are holding less money than desired, they will","A) sell bonds, and the interest rate will rise.","B) sell bonds, and the interest rate will fall.","C) buy bonds, and the interest rate will rise.","D) buy bonds, and the interest rate will fall.","E) buy goods, and the price level will rise.",A,The Market for Money,False
24,"19) If households and firms find they are holding more money than desired, they will","A) sell bonds, and the interest rate will rise.","B) sell bonds, and the interest rate will fall.","C) buy bonds, and the interest rate will rise.","D) buy bonds, and the interest rate will fall.","E) buy goods, and the price level will rise.",D,The Market for Money,False
