24,"9) The money multiplier can also be calculated as ________, where a is the currency drain ratio and b is the desired reserve ratio.",A) (a + b)  (1 + b),B) a  (a + b),C) (1 + a)  (a + b),D) (a + b)  (1 + a),E) (1 + b)  (a + b),C,Mathematical Note: The Money Multiplier,False
