28,7) If the natural unemployment rate rises,A) the long-run Phillips curve shifts rightward and the short-run Phillips curve does not change.,B) the long-run Phillips curve shifts leftward and the short-run Phillips curve does not change.,C) the short-run Phillips curve shifts rightward and the long-run Phillips curve does not change.,D) the short-run and long-run Phillips curves both shift leftward.,E) the short-run and long-run Phillips curves both shift rightward.,E,Inflation and Unemployment: The Phillips Curve,False
